    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 76,
      "text": "If you were able to attend school from home that would't be the best choice,",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 77,
      "end": 241,
      "text": "and the reasons why is cause you would be getting lazy and you would e getting used to that laziness, for me i rather go to school to actually learn and not at home",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 242,
      "end": 303,
      "text": "cause i know for sure im going to slack off most of the time,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 305,
      "end": 341,
      "text": "Being home schooled would sound nice",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "start": 342,
      "end": 594,
      "text": "but depending on the things that your learning, You can start class any time when your being home schooled, i mean hey i dont want to wake up early to go to a public school i mean no kid wants to wake up early just for that, being home schooled is nice",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 595,
      "end": 629,
      "text": "cause you can do whatever you want",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 630,
      "end": 698,
      "text": "while doing work, waking up late wouldnt be bad it would sound nice,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 699,
      "end": 923,
      "text": "students being home schooled have some lack of education cause they got used to becoming lazy and not doing anything theres no teacher to tell him/her what to do they can do whatever they want with no teacher to bother them.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 925,
      "end": 989,
      "text": "but over all attending to being home school wouldnt sound to bad",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 990,
      "end": 1036,
      "text": "but being home schooled is expansive isnt it ?",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
